<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Dotnet6 on CI-YU Blog</title><link>https://ci-yu.top/tags/dotnet6/</link><description>Recent content in Dotnet6 on CI-YU Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 24 Nov 2023 22:09:49 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://ci-yu.top/tags/dotnet6/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Dapper PostgreSQL Error</title><link>https://ci-yu.top/dotnet/dapper-postgresql-error/</link><pubDate>Fri, 24 Nov 2023 22:09:49 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://ci-yu.top/dotnet/dapper-postgresql-error/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="問題"&gt;問題&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;當使用dapper呼叫postgresql時後,需要在in裡面查詢一批陣列會遇到下方的錯誤訊息&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-C#" data-lang="C#"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; Ids = [&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;];
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;DynamicParameters parameters = &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;parameters.Add(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Ids&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, Ids);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; strSQL = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;strSQL +=&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;select * from Users where id in @Ids;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; dapper.QueryAsync(strSQL,parameters);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;42601: syntax error at or near &amp;ldquo;$1&amp;rdquo;\r\n\r\nPOSITION: 81&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 id="解法"&gt;解法&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;改語法為any就可以解決這個問題。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-C#" data-lang="C#"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; Ids = [&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;3&lt;/span&gt;,&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;4&lt;/span&gt;];
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;DynamicParameters parameters = &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt;();
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;parameters.Add(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;Ids&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, Ids);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;var&lt;/span&gt; strSQL = &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;strSQL +=&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;select * from Users where id = any(@Ids);&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;await&lt;/span&gt; dapper.QueryAsync(strSQL,parameters);
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>